flowchart TB
    P["Preview or apply pruning"] --> V{"Verified checkpoint and\naligned head / commit horizon?"}
    V -->|"No"| Keep["Keep all operation payloads"]
    V -->|"Yes"| Select["Cutoff = min(checkpoint C, HEAD - retention)\nSelect whole batches up to configured limit\nStop before first unpublished or unclassified batch"]
    Select --> Mode{"Preview only?"}
    Mode -->|"Yes"| Report["Report eligibility\nNo model-data changes"]
    Mode -->|"No"| Delete["Delete Op nodes and batchJson\nMark payloadPruned; persist progress"]
    Delete --> Retain["Keep receipts, clocks, tombstones,\ntags and recovery checkpoint"]
